  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:40px;">Yarbo vs. Traditional Equipment: The Real Cost Over Time</h3>

  <p>A Yarbo Core plus one module is a larger upfront number than a gas mower or a snow blower off a hardware store shelf. The comparison that actually matters for a large property is total cost over several years, including labor, fuel, and lawn service fees, not the sticker price of a single machine sitting next to it in a showroom.</p>

